mutation store the empty sentinel as the revision of a new record
detects TypeOK
only one tab
-      [] op.kind = "create" -> [revision |-> 1, value |-> op.value]
+      [] op.kind = "create" -> [revision |-> 0, value |-> op.value]

mutation forget to reserve a fresh identifier when creating
detects CreateAllocationsUnique
only one tab
-    /\ allocated' = allocated \cup {id}
+    /\ UNCHANGED allocated

mutation commit an edit or deletion even when another tab changed the revision
detects CommitRequiresCurrentRevision
only two tabs one id
-    ELSE records[op.id].revision # 0 /\ records[op.id].revision = op.expected
+    ELSE records[op.id].revision # 0

mutation treat an already deleted record as writable
detects CommitRequiresCurrentRevision
only two tabs one id
-    ELSE records[op.id].revision # 0 /\ records[op.id].revision = op.expected
+    ELSE records[op.id].revision = 0 \/ records[op.id].revision = op.expected

mutation publish the write even if IndexedDB reports an abort
detects RejectedWritesPreserveStore
only one tab
-       IN /\ records' = IF result = "saved" THEN [records EXCEPT ![op.id] = NewRecord(op)] ELSE records
+       IN /\ records' = IF result \in {"saved", "aborted"} THEN [records EXCEPT ![op.id] = NewRecord(op)] ELSE records

mutation clear unrelated records while committing a change
detects CommitChangesOnlyTarget
only two tabs two ids
-       IN /\ records' = IF result = "saved" THEN [records EXCEPT ![op.id] = NewRecord(op)] ELSE records
+       IN /\ records' = IF result = "saved" THEN [BlankStore EXCEPT ![op.id] = NewRecord(op)] ELSE records

mutation replace a record without incrementing its revision
detects CommitReflectsOperation
only one tab
-      [] OTHER -> [revision |-> records[op.id].revision + 1, value |-> op.value]
+      [] OTHER -> [revision |-> records[op.id].revision, value |-> op.value]

mutation overwrite one tab's draft on writes to the shared schedule store
detects DraftIsolation
only one tab
-     /\ pending' = [pending EXCEPT ![tab] = Idle]
-     /\ UNCHANGED <<allocated, started, seen, drafts>>
+     /\ pending' = [pending EXCEPT ![tab] = Idle]
+     /\ drafts' = [drafts EXCEPT ![tab] = 1]
+     /\ UNCHANGED <<allocated, started, seen>>

mutation retain an earlier snapshot when a tab reloads the current records
detects ReadsReflectStore
only one tab
-    /\ seen' = [seen EXCEPT ![tab] = Snapshot(records, id)]
+    /\ UNCHANGED seen
